## How to Run a Profile

1. Read profile from `DynamicsCrm.DevKit.Cli\Properties\launchSettings.json`
2. Extract `workingDirectory` and `commandLineArgs`
3. `cd` to `workingDirectory`
4. Run CLI exe with `commandLineArgs`
